      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CONSIGLIERE (7) has a strong record this trip with 12 wins and eight placings from 29 starts. Below best last time at Wentworth Park (30.08) in a NG, finishing a 8 length seventh. Looks suited and should go close. FLYING DUCATI (6) has been out of the placings at his last two outings but shapes well for this if he can recapture his head turning win a few runs back, getting around Warragul over 460m in 25.73. Has the ability and looks a key chance. PAW ORENTHAL (2) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 515m behind Opawa Fannin (30.06) in a Grade 4. Was in the money prior to that. Great chance to atone. PLEASANT DREAMS (1) must be included in calculations.",
